# URL validation

## Rejected targets

`POST /api/v1/urls` returns `400` for a target URL that:

- is not `http` or `https`, is longer than 2048 characters, or points at this service (existing rules);
- embeds credentials (`https://user:password@host`);
- uses an IP address (IPv4 or IPv6 literal) instead of a domain name;
- uses a local-only host: `localhost`, `*.localhost`, `*.local` or `*.internal`.

## Notes

The checks are static: there are no network calls and no external reputation services.
